The busiest Indian and Pakistani restaurant in America isn’t in New York or LA. It’s tucked away in Houston, where the line out the door is just another part of the experience. 💯

@Aga’s serves around 4,000 people a day, yet somehow the whole place runs smoother than most fine dining spots. The staff switches languages mid-order without missing a beat, and the kitchen? Controlled frenzy in its most delicious form. 😋

Garlic naan, lollipop chicken, lamb curry, lamb chops, and a lassi so good it made @Reach rethink every one he’s had before. It’s no wonder Aga’s isn’t just a restaurant—it’s a Houston landmark. 🙌🏼 #indianfood #houston #texas

